<p. 6> tadevaṃ rūpamanuvasat ai iti(,) a ā u ū o iti(,) a ā o iti(,) au iti(,) unmeṣe'pi 
vācyam | evamicchājñāne anuttarapadalīne bindumātraśeṣatayā aṃ iti(,) sa eva 
parameśvaraḥ śāktavisargapradhānatayā aḥ iti | dharādiśaktyantaṃ 
kādikṣāntavimarśaśaktiḥ ṣoḍaśī kalā iti gīyate |

uktaṃ ca tantrāloke

puruṣe ṣoḍaśakale tāmāhuḥ paramāṃ kalām |

iti | akārasya ghanatvaṃ kavargaḥ kaṇṭhyatvāt(,) evaṃ ikārasya 
cavargastālavyatvāt(,) ukārasya pavarga auṣṭhyatvāt(,) ṛkārasya ṭavargo 
mūrdhanyatvāt(,) ḷkārasya tavargo dantyatvāt(,) yaśau cavargasyāntaḥ raṣau 
ṭavargasya lasau tavargasya(,) vakāro'pi tapavargayārdhanatā | evamamūrtasyāpi 
ciddhanasya kriyāśaktirūpataiva(,) svarāḥ śivabījātmakāḥ śāktarūpaṃ kusu 
matayā tiṣṭhantaḥ kādayaḥ kṣāntā yonirityabhidhīyate(,) evaṃ varṇānāṃ 
ghanībhāvo'parāvākvapuṣi tiṣṭhan vaikharīrūpaṃ sphuṭī bhavati || 8 ||

sarveṣāmeva mantrāṇāṃ vidyānāṃ ca yaśasvini || 8 ||
iyaṃ yoni samākhyātā sarvatantreṣu sarvathā |

	iyaṃ varṇasṛṣṭirādiḥ kṣāntā(,) yonirutpattikāraṇam | uktaṃ ca 
mahārthamañjaryām 

mananamaye nijavibhave
nijasaṅkocabhaye trāṇamayī |
kavalitaviśvavikalpā 
anubhūtiḥ kāpi mantraśabdārthaḥ ||

iti || 8 ||

<p. 7> atha mahāmantrasyoddhāramāha (-) 

caturdaśayutaṃ bhadre tithīśāntasamanvitam || 9 ||
tṛtīyaṃ brahma suśroṇi hṛdayaṃ bhairavātmanaḥ |

	aghora iti tryakṣaraṃ svareṣu vartamānaṃ(,) tṛtīyaṃ brahma aghorākhyaṃ 
yat caturdaśasvareṣu yutaṃ saṃbaddhaṃ sa akāraḥ tithiḥ pañcadaśaḥ svaraḥ 
aṃkāraḥ tena yutaścāsau śāntaḥ śavargānto dvaḥ tena ahamiti yo vimarśaḥ 
paśyantīvāgrūpaḥ 

