<p. 8> prakāśo'rthoparakto'pi sphuṭikādijaḍopamaḥ || (ī0 pra0 1 | 5 | 11 )

iti | athaca tṛtīyaṃ brahma aghoramantraḥ citparāmarśayuto bhairavātmanaḥ 
svacchandabhairavasya hṛdayaṃ sārabhūto mahāmantraḥ || 9 ||

etannāyoginījāto nārudro labhate sphuṭam || 10 ||
hṛdayaṃ devadevasya sadyo yogavimokṣadam |

etadahantāparāmarśātmakaṃ sarvavedyaṃ kimapi paramaṃ hṛdayaṃ 
rahasyabhūtaṃ devadevasya cidātmano nārudro yoginīvyatiriktajāto na sphuṭaṃ 
labhate nopalabhate | yaśca rudrāṃśo bhāvibhairavībhāvo na syāt sa ca 
nopalabhate | sphuṭamiti dehāhaṃbhāvanyakkāreṇa citpradhānyena yaccopalabhate 
sa yoginījāto rudrāṃśaśca pratyāsannabhairavībhāvaḥ sadyo lābhakṣaṇa eva 
yogavimokṣadaṃ yogaścidātmasamāpattirvimokṣaścidekamayatā tadddātīti || 10 
||

paśyantīvācoccāre kṛte'sya mahimānamāha (-) 

asyoccāre kṛte samyaṅmantramudrāgaṇo mahān || 11 ||
sadyastanmukhatāmeti svadehāveśalakṣaṇam |

asya mahāmantrasya ahamityevaṃlakṣaṇasya aghoramantrasya ca uccāre avirataṃ 
tattaddevatānusaṃdhānena parāmarśe samyāgiti 
dehāhaṃbhāvavismaraṇapūrvaṃ citpradhānyena kṛte sati mantramudrāgaṇo 
mahān mantramudrādevatāsamūhaḥ sadyo vimarśakṣaṇa eva tanmukhatāṃ 
tasya yoginaḥ saṃmukhatvameti(,) kathaṃ svadehāveśa lakṣaṇaṃ svadehe yogidehe 
āveśo devānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ lakṣma yatra saṃmukhatvaprāptau || 11 ||

<p. 9> atha samādheḥ samayogena prabhāvamāha (-) 

muhūrta smarate yastu cummakenābhimudritaḥ || 12 ||
saṃbadhnāti tadā sarvaṃ mantramudrāgaṇaṃ naraḥ |
atītānāgatānarthān pṛṣṭo'sau kathayatyapi || 13 ||

yo yogī cumbakena śāktasparśena abhimudritaḥ saṃbaddho muhūrtaṃ 
ghaṭikāyugmaṃ cidātmānaṃ smarate nirantaraṃ ahamityevaṃ parāmṛśati(,) sa 
eva naro mantramudrāgaṇaṃ mantrāṇāṃ mudrāṇāṃ ca devagaṇaṃ(,) tadā 
svasvāmibhāvena saṃbadhnāti pratyakṣīkurute(,) sa eva vyutthāne kenacita 
śubhāśubhaṃ svasya jagato vā pṛṣṭaḥ san atītānāgatān 
bhūtabhaviṣyatkālena vyavahitān arthān prayojanāni kathayati tasya vāṇī na 
vyabhicaratītyarthaḥ || 13 ||

praharādyadabhipretaṃ devatārūpamuccaran |
sākṣātpaśyatyasaṃdigdhamākṛṣṭaṃ rudraśaktibhiḥ || 14 ||

	praharāditi lyablope pañcamī(,) praharamātraṃ devatārūpaṃ 
cidātmānamadhiṣṭhāya samuccaran parāmṛśan samādhistho yogī 
yadyadabhipretamabhimatamindrādidevatārūpaṃ syāt tattaddevatārūpa 
masaṃdigdhaṃ sākṣāt paśyati rudraśaktibhiḥ 
parameśaśaktiṃbhirvrāhmyādibhirākṛṣṭaṃ noditam || 14 ||

praharadvayamātreṇa vyomastho jāyate smaran |
trayeṇa mātaraḥ sarvā yogeśvaryo mahābalāḥ || 15 ||
vīrā vīreśvarāḥ siddhā balavāñcchākinīgaṇaḥ |
āgatya samayaṃ labdhvā bhairaveṇa pracoditāḥ || 16 ||
yacchanti paramāṃ siddhiṃ phalaṃ yadvā samīhitam |

praharadvayaṃ cet smaran samādhau viśrānto yogī vyomastho jāyate khagatiṃ 
prāpnoti samādhiviśrāntatvāt(,) praharatrayaṃ cet samādhiviśrāntastadā 
bhairavanāthādājñāmādāya tena preritā mātaro brāhmyādyāḥ 
pañcavidhakṛtakāriṇyaḥ vīrā yogino vīreśvarā yogīndrāḥ siddhāḥ 
kapilādayaḥ śaktinīgaṇo yoginīsamūhaḥ tasmai praharatrayaṃ samādhisthāya 
yogine samīpamāgatya paramāṃ pūrṇāṃ siddhiṃ svasyāḥ 
prakṛteryatheṣṭaviniyoktṛtvalakṣaṇaṃ svātantryaṃ(,) tathā yadanyat kāṅkṣitaṃ 
phalaṃ tad dāsyanti || 16 ||

anena siddhāḥ setsyanti sādhayanti ca mantriṇaḥ || 17 ||
yat kiñcidbhairavetantre sarvamasmāt prasidhyati |

anenaivāhamiti (-)  cidānandaviśrāntilakṣaṇena samādhinā aghoramantreṇa ca 
siddhā yogino janmamokṣānyataraparigrahe svatantrāḥ saṃpadyante sādhayanti 
anyānapi siddhān saṃpādayiṣyanti | tathā asyaiva mahāmantropāsakasya yat 
kiñcid bhairavetantre phalamuktaṃ tat sarvamasmāt mahāmantropāsanarūpāt 
samādheraghoramantrataśca siddhyati || 17 ||

adṛṣṭamaṇḍalo'pyevaṃ yaḥ kiñcidvetti tattvataḥ || 18 ||
sa siddhibhāg bhavennityaṃ sa yogī sa ca dīkṣitaḥ |

	yaḥ kiściditi varṇāśramavibhāgādhikāravyatiriktastattvato 
dehāhaṃbhāvanyakkāreṇa evaṃ uktaprakāreṇa mahāmantraṃ vetti(,) 
so'dṛṣṭamaṇḍalo'pi dīkṣāvidhāne yat prayuktaṃ maṇḍalaṃ 
kalaśayāgādidevatācakraṃ tat tenādṛṣṭamapi(,) evamīdṛśaḥ sannapi siddhibhāk 
nityayogī dīkṣitaśca bhavati | uktaṃ ca (-)

svasvarūpaparijhānaṃ mantro'yaṃ pāramārthikaḥ |
p. 11> dīkṣeyameṣa yogaśca kriyāyā apyanuttaraḥ ||

iti | yogo navanābhasaṃjñaḥ(,) kalaśamaṇḍalājhisādhana (-) carusādhana (-) 
śiṣyasaṃskāra (-) nyāsavidhāna (-) pāśasūtrasaṃskāra (-) svapnaparīkṣā (-) 
yāgavidhāna (-) rudrāṃśāpādana (-) kalāpañcakaśodhana (-) 
yojanikopadeśābhiṣeka (-) pavitrārohaṇa (-) visarjanāntāyāḥ kriyāyāḥ 
karmānuṣṭhānādapi anuttaro'tyutkṛṣṭaḥ || 18 || 

anena jñātamatreṇa jñāyate sarvaśaktibhiḥ || 19 ||
śākinīkulasāmānyo bhavedyogaṃ vināpi hi |
avidhijño vidhānajño jāyate yajanaṃ prati || 20 ||

	anena mahāmantreṇa bhairaveśvarasya sarvābhiḥ śaktibhirjñāyate 
svakīyatve saḥ(,) tathā yogaṃ vināpi vyutthāne vartamānaḥ 
śākinīkulasāmānyaḥ śākinīkulasya yoginīgaṇasya sāmānyaḥ sādhāraṇaḥ 
krīḍanako bhavet | pūrvamavidhijño'pi anenaiva mahāmantreṇa jñātena 
dīkṣāyā yajanaṃ prati vidhānajño jāyate || 20 ||

kālāgnimāditaḥ kṛtvā māyāntaṃ brahmadehagam |
śivo viśvādyanantāntaḥ paraṃ śaktitrayaṃ matam || 21 ||

	nivṛttikalāyāḥ pādāgrādgulphāntaṃ vyāptiḥ tatraiva bhūtattvasthitiḥ 
brahmaṇo'dhikṛtiḥ | pratiṣṭhāyā gulphānnābhyantaṃ vyāptiḥ tatra 
jalatattvamārabhya prakṛtitattvāntaṃ caturviṃśatitattvasthitiḥ tatra 
viṣṇoradhikṛtiḥ | vidyāyā nābhestālvantaṃ vyāptiḥ(,) tatra puruṣatattvamārabhya 
māyātattvāntaṃ saptatattvasthitiḥ(,) tatra rudrasyādhikṛtiḥ | 
śāntākalāyāstāluno bindvantaṃ vyāptiḥ tatra śuddhavidyāditattvatrayasthitiḥ(,) 
tatra īśvarasyādhikṛtiḥ |
	puruṣaniyatikālarāgavidyākalāmāyātattvāni sapta(,) 
śuddhavidyātattveśvaratattvasadāśivākhyāni trīṇi tattvāni(,) bhūtāni pañca(,) 
ghīndriyāni pañca(,) karmendriyāni pañca(,) viṣayāḥ pañca(,) antaḥkaraṇāni trīṇi(,) 
prakṛtirekā(,) nivṛttāvaṣṭottaraśataṃ bhuvanāni(,) pratiṣṭhāyāṃ ṣaṭpañcāśat(,) 
vidyāyāṃ saptaviṃśatiḥ(,) śāntāyāṃ saptadaśa(,) śāntyatītāyāṃ ṣoḍaśa(,) 
evaṃ sarvāṇi bhuvanāni caturviṃśatyadhikaṃ dviśatam | śāntyatītāyā bindoḥ 
karandhrāntaṃ vyāptiḥ(,) tatra anantavyāptaśivatattvasthitiḥ tatra 
anāśritaśivasyādhikṛtiḥ | atra tu saṃkṣepeṇaiva etatkramaḥ | kālāgniṃ 
kālāgnisthānaṃ pādāgraṃ āditaḥ kṛtvā tadārabhya māyāntaṃ 
māyātattvāntaṃ brahmotyupalakṣaṇaṃ tena brahmaviṣṇudehagamiti tālvantaṃ 
sthitau(,) brahma iti napuṃsako nirdeśa eśaḥ pāṭhaḥ | śivo māyordhve 
viśvādyanantānto viśvabhuvanācchuddhavidyāderārabhya anantānto 
anantabhuvanāvadhi adhiṣṭhātā sthitaḥ(,) ataḥ paraṃ śaktitrayaṃ vidyā  (-) 
śāntā (-) śāntyatītāditrayaṃ  sūkṣmamutkṛṣṭaṃ ca matam || 21 ||

kuta ityāha (-)

tadantarvarti yatkiñcit śuddhamārge vyavasthitam |
aṇurviśuddhamacirādaiśvaraṃ jñānamaśnute || 22 ||

	tasya śaktitrayasya antarvarti yadadhvarūpaṃ 
tattvabhuvanāvasthādimadhyasthitaṃ tat śuddhamārge vyavasthitaṃ 
māyākāluṣyatānavatāratamyādaṇurjīvo yogamabhyasyan śuddhādhvani 
pratiṣṭhito'cirād aiśvaraṃ jñānaṃ viśuddhaṃ bhedaprathārahitaṃ prāpnoti | 
ṣaḍadhvānaḥ varṇapadamantrabhuvanatattvakalātmānaḥ(,) trayo vācakāstrayo 
vācyāḥ || 22 ||

taccodakaḥ śivo jñeyaḥ sarvajñaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
sarvago nirmalaḥ svacchastṛptaḥ svāyatanaḥ śuciḥ || 23 ||

taccodakaḥ tasya īśvarajñānasya codako'nugrahabhājanaṃ kañcideva 
yogivaryaṃ prati prayojakaḥ śivakalādhiṣṭhātajñeyaḥ(,) yataḥ sa eva sarvajñaḥ | 
yaduktam (-)

eko bhāvastattvato yena dṛṣṭaḥ sarve bhāvāstattvatastena dṛṣṭāḥ | iti 
parameśvaro'deyamapi dātuṃ samarthaḥ | sarvago vyāpakaḥ | sarvago 
māyīyamalarahitaḥ | svacchaḥ āṇavamalarahitaḥ | tṛptaḥ kārmamalarahitatvāt 
nirākāṅghaḥ | svāyatanaścidātmani pratiṣṭhitaḥ | śucirnivāsanaḥ | ītādṛganyo 
devaḥ ko'pi nāsti | malatrayalakṣaṇaṃ śrīpratyabhijñāyām (-)

svātantryahānirbodhasya svātantryasyāpyabodhatā |
dvidhāṇavaṃ malamidaṃ svasvarūpāpahānitaḥ ||
bhinnavedyaprathātraiva māyākhyaṃ janmabhogadam |
kartaryabodhe kārmaṃ tu māyāśaktyaiva tattrayam || (ī0 pra0 3 | 2 | 4 |)
iti || 23 ||

	nanu aṇorjīvasya saṅkucitasya pūrṇavyāpakeśvarajñānaṃ 
durghaṭamanumīyate jalabindorivārṇavatvaprāptirityato dṛṣṭāntanidarśanena 
samyagbodhayati (-)

yathānyagrodhabījasthaḥ śaktirūpo mahādrumaḥ |
tathā hṛdayabījasthaṃ jagadetaccarācaram || 24 ||

	<p. 14> nyagrodhabīje vaṭavṛkṣabīje śaktirūpo hṛdayabījaṃ 
śuddhacitparāmarśātmaparārūpaṃ tatra sthitaṃ carācarātmakaṃ 
jagadvistīrṇaṃ hṛdayabījasthaṃ sūkṣmarūpeṇa sthitamato na 
kiñcidasamañjasam || 24 ||

evaṃ yo vetti tattvena tasya nirvāṇagāminī |
dīkṣā bhavatyasaṃdigdhā tilājyāhutivarjitā || 25 ||

	tattvena dehāhaṃbhāvatiraskāreṇa cidātmapratiṣṭhayā yo vetti 
saṃvedayate | dīkṣeti (-)

dadāti jñānasadbhāvaṃ kṣapayatyakhilaṃ malam |
bodhānuvedhād dīkṣoktā dānakṣapaṇadharmiṇī ||

	ityādinā lakṣitā mokṣāvahā(,) tilājyā(,) iti bāhyopaka 
raṇamanapekṣamāṇā(,) nātra saṃśayaḥ || 25 ||

evamāntarīṃ sūkṣmāṃ pūjāmabhidhāya bāhyapūjopalakṣaṇamāḥ 
tramapyāha (-)

mūrdhni vaktre ca hṛdaye guhye mūrtau tathaiva ca |
nyāsaṃ kṛtvā śikhāṃ baddhvā saptaviṃśatimantritām || 26 ||

	īśānamūrdhne namaḥ(,) tatpuruṣavaktrāya namaḥ(,) aghorahṛdayāya namaḥ(,) 
vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ(,) sadyojātamūrtaye namaḥ(,) iti mantreṇa nyāsaṃ kṛtvā 
aghoramantreṇa ca saptaviṃśativāramaṣṭottaraśatākṣamālāpādena mantritāṃ 
śikhāṃ baddhvā || 26 ||

ekaikaṃ tu diśāṃ bandhaṃ daśānāmapi yojayet |
tālatrayaṃ purā datvā saśabdaṃ vighnaśāntaye || 27 ||

choṭikābhirdaśabhiḥ(,)

bhūtāḥ pretāḥ piśācāśca rākṣasāśca sarīsṛpāḥ |
<p. 15> apasarpantu te sarve divyāstreṇa tāḍitāḥ ||

iti mantreṇa digbandhaṃ prayojayet(,) 

apasarpantu te bhūtā ye bhūtā bhuvi saṃsthitāḥ |
ye bhūtā vighnakartāraste naśyantu śivājñayā || 

iti mantreṇa pūrvaṃ pārṣṇyāghātatrayaṃ kṛtvā(,)

pāṣāṇḍakāriṇo bhūtā bhūtā bhūmyantarikṣagāḥ |
divi loke sthitā ye ca te naśyantu śivājñayā ||

iti | saśabdaṃ tālatrayaṃ dattvā pratyūhopaśamanāya || 27 ||

śikhāsaṃkhyātijaptena toyenābhyukṣayettataḥ |
puṣpādikaṃ kramāt sarvaṃ liṅge vā sthaṇḍile'thavā || 28 ||
caturdaśābhijaptena puṣpeṇāsanakalpanā |

	nairṛte'strārghapātre saptaviṃśativāramaghoramantreṇa mantritaṃ toyaṃ 
vidhāya jñānasvaṅgena puṣpagandhākṣatādikaṃ pūjopakaraṇamabhyukṣayet 
śodhanārthaṃ siñcet | tato mṛnmayādiliṅge sthaṇḍile vā yāgabhūmau 
vihitāṣṭadalakamalādike vā darpaṇapratibimbite caturdaśavāramaghorābhijaptena 
puṣpeṇa iti puṣpāsanādikāṃ pūjāṃ kuryāt || 18 ||

tataḥ sṛṣṭiṃ yajedvīraḥ punarevāsanaṃ tataḥ || 29 ||
sṛṣṭiṃ tu saṃpuṭīkṛtya punaryajanamārabhet |

	tato vāhyapūjānantaramakārādihakārāntāṃ varṇasṛṣṭiṃ yajet 
liṅgādau ca pūjayet aṃ namaḥ ityevam(,) punareva vīro yogīndro 
dhyānayogāsanaṃ vidhāya akārādihakārāntāṃ sṛṣṭiṃ saṃpuṭīkṛtya 
pratyāhṛtya ahamiti cittattve pratiṣṭhito bhūtvā punaryajanamāntarīṃ 
pūjāmārabhet | ātmāmarśanamevābhyantarī pūjā || 29 ||

<p. 16> tato bhāvanayā pūjā (-)

sarvatattvasusaṃpūrṇā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 30 ||
yajeddevīṃ maheśānīṃ saptaviśatimantritām |
tataḥ sugandhipuṣpaistu yathāśaktyā samarcayet || 31 ||
pūjayet parayā bhaktyā ātmānaṃ ca nivedayet |

	sarvatattvaiḥ ṣaṭtriṃśat tattvaiḥ susaṃpūrṇāṃ nirbharāṃ 
sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ maheśvarīṃ parāṃ devīmaghoramantreṇa parayā 
bhaktyā atyādareṇa pūjayet gandhapuṣpādibhirātmānaṃ ca nivedayet 
samarpayet || 31 ||

evaṃ yajanamākhyātamagnikārye'pyayaṃ vidhiḥ || 32 ||
kṛtapūjāvidhiḥ samyak smaran bījaṃ prasidhyati |

	evaṃ dviprakāraṃ yajanaṃ pūjanamuktaṃ agnikārye homādāvapi ayaṃ 
vidhiḥ(,) eṣa eva prakāro dvividhaḥ evamuktavidhayā kṛtapūjāvidhiryogī samyag 
dehāhantāṃ vismārya jagato varṇānāṃ ca bījaṃ mūlakāraṇaṃ cittattvaṃ 
nityamanavarataṃ vyutthāne'pi smaran pratyavamṛśan prasidhyati anuttarāṃ 
jñānadhārāmadhirohati || 32 ||

	atha dhyānayoganiṣṭhasya yoginaḥ saprakāraṃ smaraṇe 
rahasyopadeśamāha (-)

ādyantarahitaṃ bījaṃ vikasattithimadhyagam || 33 ||
hṛtpadmāntargataṃ dhyāyet somāṃśaṃ nityamabhyaset |

	jagato varṇānāṃ vā bījaṃ parārūpaṃ cidātmakaṃ tattvaṃ bījaṃ 
māṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ (------------------------------------) |

<p. 17> iti gītāsūktam | vikasaditi vikasanto akārādihakārāntaṃ prasaranto 

	amūlā tat kramāt jñeyā (------------------------------------) | (8 ślo0 )

	ityatra jñātamātreṇa vyañjanarūpeṇa pariṇamanto vaikharyāṃ vāci 
spaṣṭatāṃ gacchataśca te tithayaḥ pañcadaśa svarāsteṣāṃ madhyagaṃ 
tadantarvarti ahamityevaṃ svābhedena natu dhyeyatvena hṛtpadmāntargataṃ 
dhyāyet rājayogavit gurupadeśena anuśīlayet gururupāyaḥ || (śi0 sū0 2 | 9 )

